    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u2665\u2665 ADD IN WISHLIST!! \u2665\u2665</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no gameplay in this game, and you can see additional endings that do not exist in the main story of Slave Princess Finne here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is one of the &quot;what if&quot; episodes of Slave Princess Finne!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the story of Finne's - what if?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The human route and the elven route are included</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Human route story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If &quot;Kimota&quot;, a resident of Grant City, finds a mysterious crystal, what will happen to Finne?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elf Route Story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finne is on a journey to win the battle of the princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being sold to a slave market, she is bought by a rich man named &quot;Mori&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short RPG story presentation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional story content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mini-game is recommended to be played after playing the main story of &quot;Slave Princess Finne&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slave Princess Finne ~ IF Story Trilogy\uff01</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no gameplay in this game, and you can see additional endings that do not exist in the main story of Slave Princess Finne here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is one of the &quot;what if&quot; episodes of Slave Princess Finne!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is the story of Finne's - what if?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The human route and the elven route are included</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Human route story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If &quot;Kimota&quot;, a resident of Grant City, finds a mysterious crystal, what will happen to Finne?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elf Route Story.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finne is on a journey to win the battle of the princess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being sold to a slave market, she is bought by a rich man named &quot;Mori&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Short RPG story presentation</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additional story content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This mini-game is recommended to be played after playing the main story of &quot;Slave Princess Finne&quot;.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slave Princess Finne ~ IF Story Trilogy\uff01</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >   </p>",
